    </example>

    <example>
        <statement>
            <p>
                Let's reconsider the same example but adjust a couple of things. This time, let's suppose the claim is that at least 9 in 10 dentists prefer Sensodyne, and that you are willing to concede on your morals and will accept 90% confidence. 
            </p>
